'''Ancient Egg: N003''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] unlocked when beating [[Empress' Excavation 2]]. It was added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]]. [[True Form]] improves almost all attributes and gains immunity to [[Surge Attack]]s.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 669
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Ancient Egg: N003
|name2 = Evil Egg: N003
|name3 = Cat Cactus
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Evil Egg: N003''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Cat Cactus''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit#Behemoth Stones|Behemoth Stones]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
==='''Normal/Evolved Form'''===
These forms are <u>useless by design</u>. Similarly to the other [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]], this unit is not meant to be used before its True Form. However, due to its somewhat low cost and quick recharge, reverting to this form may prove useful if a cheaper, more spammable meatshield is needed in an [[Underground Labyrinth]] or [[Legend Quest]] stage.

==='''True Form'''===
This Cat is quite similar to [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], targeting Aku instead of Alien. Its main function is to be an Aku meatshield, but it can also be used as a filler [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge Immune]] meatshield. Unfortunately due to its somewhat high cost, it can be expensive to spam as a filler meatshield, but it's manageable when used as a primary meatshield. As with other specialist meatshields, Cactus greatly benefits from being boosted with Catseyes, being able to reach ~63k HP against Aku at level 50. Once you obtain [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]], however, this cat becomes far less relevant as Maize is better in nearly all anti-Aku scenarios. Luckily for Cactus, its general anti-Surge value remains untouched by Maize Cat.

